# UK Athletics Age Rules

The most important domain rule in the platform.

## The 31 August rule

An athlete's age group is their age on **31 August at the END of the athletics season** the session falls in.

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A[Session date] --> B{Month >= September?}
    B -->|Yes — new season| C[Season end year = current year + 1]
    B -->|No — current season| D[Season end year = current year]
    C & D --> E[Reference date: 31 Aug of season end year]
    E --> F[Age = ageOnDate dob refDate]
    F --> G[Match against age_groups table]
    G --> H{booking_type?}
    H -->|taster| I[Booking invite path]
    H -->|waitlist| J[Academy waitlist path]
    H -->|no match| I
```

## Examples

| Session | Season | Reference date | DOB | Age on ref | Group |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| 14 Oct 2026 | 2026/27 | 31 Aug **2027** | 1 Sep 2016 | 10 | U11 |
| 14 Apr 2026 | 2025/26 | 31 Aug **2026** | 1 Sep 2016 | 9 | U11 |
| 14 Apr 2026 | 2025/26 | 31 Aug **2026** | 1 Sep 2014 | 11 | U13 |
| 31 Aug 2026 | 2025/26 | 31 Aug **2026** | 1 Sep 2013 | 12 | U13 |

> The season switches on **1 September**. A session on 31 August is still in the old season.

## Implementation (`src/lib/business/age.ts`)

```typescript
athleticsSeasonEndYear("2026-10-14")  // → 2027  (Oct is in new season)
athleticsSeasonEndYear("2026-04-14")  // → 2026  (Apr is in current season)

ageForAthletics(dob, sessionDate)
// = ageOnDate(dob, `${seasonEndYear}-08-31`)

resolveAgeGroup(dob, sessionDate, allAgeGroups)
// Finds first active group where athleticsAge >= age_min AND <= age_max
// Sorted by sort_order — lowest wins if multiple match
```

## Enquiry routing

```mermaid
graph LR
    Enquiry[Enquiry submitted] --> Resolve[resolveAgeGroup\nbusiness/age.ts]
    Resolve --> Route[routeEnquiry\nbusiness/enquiry.ts]
    Route -->|booking_type = waitlist| WL[addToWaitlist\n→ Academy email]
    Route -->|booking_type = taster\nor no DOB| Inv[createInviteForEnquiry\n→ Booking invite email]
```

